<h1 id="cookie-notice">Cookie Notice</h1>
<p><strong>Last updated:</strong> [EFFECTIVE DATE]</p>
<p>This notice explains the cookies and similar technologies that <strong>127 Group LLC</strong> (&quot;127&quot;) uses on 127group.io and app.127group.io. It's part of our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
<h3 id="the-short-version">The short version</h3>
<ul class="bul">
<li>We use a few essential cookies and browser-storage items to keep you signed in and remember your progress.</li>
<li>Our analytics (Plausible) don't use cookies and don't track you across sites.</li>
<li>Advertising tools from Meta, TikTok and Klaviyo run <strong>only if you click &quot;Accept&quot;</strong>, never inside the member app, and never if your browser sends a Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track signal.</li>
<li>Change your choice anytime with <strong>Cookie settings</strong> in the footer.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="what-these-technologies-are">What these technologies are</h2>
<p><strong>Cookies</strong> are small text files a website stores in your browser. <strong>Local storage</strong> is a similar browser feature that keeps information on your device. <strong>Pixels</strong> are small pieces of code from another company (like Meta or TikTok) that tell that company when you visit a page or complete an action, and can set that company's cookies.</p>
<h2 id="what-we-use">What we use</h2>
