<h2 id="your-choices">Your choices</h2>
<ul class="bul">
<li><strong>Cookie settings:</strong> use the link in the site footer to accept or reject advertising cookies at any time. If you reject after accepting, we delete the ad cookies on our domain that we can and reload the page.</li>
<li><strong>Browser privacy signals:</strong> if your browser sends Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track, we treat it as a &quot;no&quot; to advertising cookies and don't ask.</li>
<li><strong>Browser controls:</strong> you can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking essential cookies will stop sign-in from working.</li>
<li><strong>Ad settings:</strong> you can also manage ad preferences in your Meta and TikTok account settings.</li>
</ul>
